# Unlike relay-server/counter-service, this folder's node_modules is NOT
# committed. Electron's own binary alone is ~180MB - over GitHub's 100MB
# per-file limit - and Electron apps aren't distributed by git-cloning an
# unpacked runtime tree anyway. Instead: build a packaged installer here
# (`npm run dist`, via electron-builder) and copy just that one .exe to the
# counter PC directly (USB, etc.), never through git. See CLAUDE.md.
node_modules/
dist/
data/
logs/
tmp/
.env
